# Direct validation dependencies. CI installs the selected Home Assistant
# matrix version separately. Dependabot updates requirements-dev.txt;
# requirements-dev-min-ha.txt is curated manually for the minimum matrix.
# Home Assistant itself is locked per CI matrix.
#
# pymodbus is the integration's runtime requirement. It is listed here so the
# local validation environment matches the pin in manifest.json; Home Assistant
# resolves it from the manifest at install time.
